      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A number of studies have been conducted to determine the effectiveness of veralipride (Agreal) in the treatment of the psycho-functional manifestations of menopause. All of these studies have obtained essentially similar results: very good effectiveness, in the order of 80 p. cent against hot flushes; very satisfactory effectiveness against the psycho-functional syndrome (50 to 70 p. cent). Headaches were the least affected by treatment (about 40 p. cent good results)."},
